Savvy is a desktop YouTube client built with Tauri + Rust + SvelteKit.

This project reuses code and design tokens from Limusic
(https://github.com/SimoHypers/limusic), which is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. The Catppuccin/Mauve theme,
font system, layout conventions, and several supporting crates are
derived from that work.

Limusic copyright (C) SimoHypers and contributors.

